acceptance_criteria: "plan update-step persists --file, --test, and --doc evidence onto the step record through CLI, SDK, and MCP; Evidence fields round-trip through storage and are visible in plan reads and history entries; Unsupported or malformed evidence input fails with a typed error instead of being silently discarded; Coverage asserts persistence and rejection paths on the same plan"
parent: pm-usfg
resolution: "Plan update-step persists and deduplicates file, test, and doc evidence."
expected_result: "Plan update-step persists and deduplicates file, test, and doc evidence."
actual_result: "Plan update-step persists and deduplicates file, test, and doc evidence. Verification: linked tests, full coverage, static/security gates, packed consumer, clean-runner CI follow-up, and synchronized terminal metadata passed."
